@startuml ARCH-04a-候选部署图-云中立基线
title 图 ARCH-04a 候选部署图·云中立基线（UML 部署图 / 状态：Proposed / ADR-014, ADR-035）
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho

node "用户手持终端\n<<device>> Android 12+ 移动设备" as Node_Android #F1F8E9 {
    node "Android OS 沙箱运行环境" as Env_Android {
        artifact "IntelligentReader.apk\n<<executable package>>\n[签名 release 构建包]" as Art_APK
        database "应用私有目录文件存储\n(源文档副本、本地 SQLite、混合索引)" as Store_Android
        Art_APK --> Store_Android : 内部读写
    }
}

node "用户桌面终端\n<<device>> Windows 11 PC 电脑" as Node_Windows #E1F5FE {
    node "Windows 11 桌面运行环境" as Env_Windows {
        artifact "IntelligentReader-win-x64.zip / setup.exe\n<<executable package>>\n[release 绿色演示包/安装包]" as Art_EXE
        database "AppData/Local 目录文件存储\n(源文档授权、本地 SQLite、混合索引)" as Store_Win
        Art_EXE --> Store_Win : 内部读写
    }
}

node "云中立计算节点\n<<node>> 标准 Linux 主机 (Ubuntu 22.04 LTS / 容器宿主机)\n[课程一期单节点同机部署验证基线 (D-35)]" as Node_Server #EDE7F6 {
    
    node "反向代理网关\n<<executionEnvironment>> Ingress Proxy" as Env_Proxy {
        artifact "Caddy / Nginx\n[TLS 1.3 证书终结, 路由分发, 限流]" as Art_Proxy
    }

    node "Java 21 / 容器运行时环境\n<<executionEnvironment>> Application Runtime" as Env_AppRuntime {
        artifact "sync-service.jar\n<<artifact>>\n[身份验证与数据同步单元]" as Art_Sync
        artifact "rag-gateway.jar\n<<artifact>>\n[证据包校验与模型适配网关]" as Art_AI
        artifact "task-worker.jar\n<<artifact>>\n[后台持久任务调度与审计执行器]" as Art_Worker
    }

    node "数据库运行环境\n<<executionEnvironment>> Database Runtime" as Env_DBRuntime {
        database "PostgreSQL 16 Engine\n<<database system>>" as PG_Inst {
            artifact "intelligent_reader_db\n(账号表, 变更流表, 任务表, 幂等记录)" as Art_DB_Data
        }
    }

    node "安全与可观测配套环境\n<<executionEnvironment>> Support Services" as Env_Support {
        artifact "秘密与环境变量注入\n(OS Secret / .env 隔离配置)" as Art_Secret
        artifact "内容无关监控与日志收集\n(Prometheus Exporter + Fluentbit)" as Art_Obs
    }

    Art_Proxy --> Art_Sync : 本地回环 (127.0.0.1:8081 / HTTP)
    Art_Proxy --> Art_AI : 本地回环 (127.0.0.1:8082 / HTTP)
    
    Art_Sync --> Art_DB_Data : TCP / 5432 (连接池, 原子事务)
    Art_AI --> Art_DB_Data : TCP / 5432 (指标写入, 审计)
    Art_Worker --> Art_DB_Data : TCP / 5432 (SELECT FOR UPDATE 抢占 lease)

    Art_Secret ..> Art_Sync : 注入数据库密码与服务密钥
    Art_Secret ..> Art_AI : 注入 OpenAI API Key
    Art_Secret ..> Art_Worker : 注入执行凭据

    Art_Sync ..> Art_Obs : 导出耗时、状态码、错误类型
    Art_AI ..> Art_Obs : 导出 Token用量、时延、失败率
    Art_Worker ..> Art_Obs : 导出任务排队、lease持有指标
}

cloud "外部受控模型基础设施\n<<node>> OpenAI Cloud Platform" as Node_OpenAI #FFF3E0 {
    artifact "Responses API Endpoint\n(gpt-5.4-mini-2026-03-17 候选模型)" as Art_OpenAI_API
}

' 客户端到服务端通信
Art_APK --> Art_Proxy : HTTPS (TCP 端口 443)\n[REST push/pull & REST/SSE 问答]
Art_EXE --> Art_Proxy : HTTPS (TCP 端口 443)\n[REST push/pull & REST/SSE 问答]

' 服务端到外部模型通信
Art_AI --> Art_OpenAI_API : HTTPS (TCP 端口 443)\n[携带本次已授权证据包]

note bottom of Node_Server
  **候选与正式部署状态说明 (D-14, D-35, ADR-014, ADR-035):**
  1. 当前状态为 **Proposed 候选部署图**。三个服务端逻辑单元（同步、AI、worker）在课程一期
     允许同机单节点部署，以降低运维复杂度与课程验证成本。
  2. 只有在完成干净环境部署验证、重启与备份恢复演练后，经项目负责人批准方可转为正式部署图。
  3. 服务端绝对禁止持久化用户源文档文件与全文索引；PostgreSQL 只存储最小结构化元数据。
end note

@enduml
